A copied frame that copied nothing leaves the pipe where it is.

Frames without a layer (the wake redraw, CoreAnimation's lock fade) went down the copy path,
copied nothing, and still pointed VIG0 at panel memory: the boot console text faded in and out
on every power press (all9). Panel memory is shown only when a layer was copied into it or is
the panel surface itself.

